      "(15) Are You Happy?",
      "",
      "The weather wasn’t good today. There was light rain.",
      "",
      "Daxing said, “Xiaomi, I am going to school. You must stay inside my clothes today.”",
      "",
      "I asked, “Why?”",
      "",
      "Daxing said, “It’s raining today. You cannot be with water.”",
      "",
      "I asked Daxing, “Cell phones cannot be with water? What about computers? TVs?”",
      "",
      "Daxing said, “None of them can be with water.”",
      "",
      "Daxing was going to school. I asked Daxing, “Daxing, are you … happy today?”",
      "",
      "Daxing said, “Yes.”",
      "",
      "“But you said studying is very tiring, and when you are tired, you aren’t happy,” I said.",
      "",
      "“I am not unhappy.” Daxing said, “Sometimes studying is very tiring.",
      "When studying is very tiring, I get a little unhappy. But because of this, when I play, I will become happier.”"
